{"parse": {"title": "衣着/生命之屋", "pageid": 150128, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"character-skin-page\"><div class=\"character-base-info\"><div class=\"character-img-box0 tabber\" style=\"margin-bottom:20px\"><div class=\"character-img-box1\"><div class=\"tabber-item hide-m\" data-isl2d=\"1\" data-tabberimg=\"Skin_bg-314003.webp\" data-tabberimgclass=\"img-fit-height\" style=\"position:absolute; right:0; height:100%;display:none;\"></div><div class=\"character-img-box2 no-select\"><img alt=\"Zhujiemian you di.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/b/bc/Zhujiemian_you_di.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"508\" height=\"612\" class=\"img-fit notpageimage\" data-file-width=\"508\" data-file-height=\"612\" /></div><div class=\"character-img-box2 tabber-item hide-pc\" data-id=\"314003\" data-isl2d=\"0\" data-tabberimg=\"Portrait-314003.webp\" data-tabberimgclass=\"img-fit\"></div><div class=\"character-img-box2 tabber-item hide-m\" data-id=\"314003\" data-isl2d=\"0\" data-tabberimg=\"Portrait-314003.webp\" data-tabberimgclass=\"img-fit\" data-tabberimglink=\"File:Portrait-314003.webp\"></div><div class=\"character-img-box2 tabber-item hide-pc\" data-isl2d=\"1\" data-tabberimg=\"L2d_static-314003_djs.webp\" data-tabberimgclass=\"img-fit\" style=\"display:none\"></div><div class=\"character-img-box2 tabber-item hide-m\" data-isl2d=\"1\" data-tabberimg=\"L2d_static-314003_djs.webp\" data-tabberimgclass=\"img-fit\" data-tabberimglink=\"File:L2d_static-314003_djs.webp\" style=\"display:none\"></div></div><div class=\"character-desc-offset\"><div class=\"character-img-button-group\"><div class=\"tabber-filter l2d-button-group\"><div class=\"l2d-button\"><img alt=\"Btm lihui.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/4/4d/Btm_lihui.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"84\" height=\"84\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"84\" data-file-height=\"84\" /></div><div class=\"tabber-item\" data-isl2d=\"0\"><div class=\"tabber-filter-item\" data-isl2d=\"1\" data-type=\"isl2d\">L2D</div></div><div class=\"tabber-item\" data-isl2d=\"1\" style=\"display:none\"><div class=\"tabber-filter-item selected\" data-isl2d=\"0\" data-type=\"isl2d\">立绘</div></div></div></div><div class=\"img-desc img-desc-only\" style=\"position:relative; padding-bottom:25px\">“你是说，我的建筑师在模型里加入了一点……灵魂？”</div><div class=\"character-spine\"><div class=\"no-select\" style=\"position:absolute; bottom:-10px\"><img alt=\"Pifuxiaorendi 008.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/a/ae/Pifuxiaorendi_008.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"240\" height=\"224\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"240\" data-file-height=\"224\" /></div><div><a href=\"/index.php?title=%E7%89%B9%E6%AE%8A:%E4%B8%8A%E4%BC%A0%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6&amp;wpDestFile=Spine_static-314003_djs.png\" class=\"new\" title=\"文件:Spine static-314003 djs.png\">文件:Spine static-314003 djs.png</a></div></div></div></div><div class=\"character-infobox\" style=\"display:block\"><div style=\"margin-bottom:20px\"><div style=\"position:relative; margin-top:5px\"><div style=\"position:absolute; top:-2px; user-select:none; pointer-events:none;\"><img alt=\"Chatacterskinviewtextbg orange.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/dc/Chatacterskinviewtextbg_orange.png/233px-Chatacterskinviewtextbg_orange.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"233\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/dc/Chatacterskinviewtextbg_orange.png/350px-Chatacterskinviewtextbg_orange.png 1.5x, https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/d/dc/Chatacterskinviewtextbg_orange.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"360\" data-file-height=\"36\" /></div><div style=\"margin-left:27px;position:relative;\">全新神秘术特效</div></div><div style=\"position:relative; margin-top:5px\"><div style=\"position:absolute; top:-2px; user-select:none; pointer-events:none;\"><img alt=\"Chatacterskinviewtextbg orange.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thu