E5%A5%A0%E5%9F%BA%E7%9F%B3\" title=\"奠基石\"><img alt=\"Bgequip6.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/08/Bgequip6.png/100px-Bgequip6.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit notpageimage\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/08/Bgequip6.png/150px-Bgequip6.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/08/Bgequip6.png/200px-Bgequip6.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></a><span class=\"item-link-img\" style=\"width:60%; padding-top:7%;\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E5%A5%A0%E5%9F%BA%E7%9F%B3\" title=\"奠基石\"><img alt=\"奠基石\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5c/HeadIconSmall-314001.png/100px-HeadIconSmall-314001.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/5/5c/HeadIconSmall-314001.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></a></span></span></span><span class=\"tooltips\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E5%A5%A0%E5%9F%BA%E7%9F%B3\" title=\"奠基石\">奠基石</a></span></span></div><div><div><span class=\"color-darkgold\" style=\"margin-right:1em\">实装版本：</span>4.0</div></div><div><div><span class=\"color-darkgold\" style=\"margin-right:3em\">来源：</span>银行</div></div><div><div><span class=\"color-darkgold\" style=\"margin-right:1em\">所属系列：</span>岁月的书签</div></div><div><div class=\"grey-small test-hide hide-m\">编号ID：314003</div></div></div></div><div class=\"skin-video tabber\"><h2><span id=\".E8.A7.86.E9.A2.91.E9.A2.84.E8.A7.88\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"视频预览\">视频预览</span></h2><div class=\"tabber-filter\" style=\"margin:0 -3px 4px -3px\"><div class=\"tabber-filter-item filter-button selected\" data-type=\"videoId\" data-videoid=\"4\">1技能</div><div class=\"tabber-filter-item filter-button\" data-type=\"videoId\" data-videoid=\"3\">2技能</div><div class=\"tabber-filter-item filter-button\" data-type=\"videoId\" data-videoid=\"2\">大招</div><div class=\"tabber-filter-item filter-button\" data-type=\"videoId\" data-videoid=\"1\">入场</div></div><div class=\"skin-video--single tabber-item\" data-videoid=\"4\" data-videourl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3140/314003/奠基石皮肤skill1.mp4\" data-backgroundurl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3140/314003/奠基石皮肤born.mp4_20260922_175859.262.png\"></div><div class=\"skin-video--single tabber-item\" data-videoid=\"3\" data-videourl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3140/314003/奠基石皮肤skill2.mp4\" data-backgroundurl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3140/314003/奠基石皮肤born.mp4_20260922_175859.262.png\" style=\"display:none\"></div><div class=\"skin-video--single tabber-item\" data-videoid=\"2\" data-videourl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3140/314003/奠基石皮肤unique.mp4\" data-backgroundurl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3140/314003/奠基石皮肤born.mp4_20260922_175859.262.png\" style=\"display:none\"></div><div class=\"skin-video--single tabber-item\" data-videoid=\"1\" data-videourl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3140/314003/奠基石皮肤born.mp4\" data-backgroundurl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3140/314003/奠基石皮肤born.mp4_20260922_175859.262.png\" style=\"display:none\"></div></div><h2><span id=\".E7.AA.97.E4.B8.AD.E4.BE.A7.E5.86.99_Garment_Display\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"窗中侧写_Garment_Display\">窗中侧写<small style=\"color: grey\"> <span style=\"display:inline-block\">Garment Display</span></small></span></h2><div class=\"infopad\">任何建筑都需要承载些许生活。<br />这座城堡也不例外，只是它的居民有一点点特殊。每逢午夜钟声响起，轻盈的床单在走廊里飞舞，火炬中燃起青绿的火焰。<br />在城堡深处，有个剪影却无暇他顾。测试“筋腱”的强度、计算“骨骼”的尺寸、调整“肌肉”的比例，她推敲每个细节，如岁月砥磨古堡内的每一块砖石。<br />哦，砖石——被生命打造，如今要重现生命的模样。这并非异想天开：一段故事，一些回忆，些许习惯，至今仍栖居于建筑的边角，可以被触摸，也可以被徘徊的魂灵们反复讲述着。<br />因此，只有这座古堡是不够的！建筑师如是说。魂灵们值得一些比棺材或是墓碑更温馨的归宿，醒来的砖石也要找地方存放岁月留下的故事。在时光飞逝、过往都混没之前，她一定会打造供所有生命安放自我的栖所。</div><div id=\"崭新单品\"></div><h2><span id=\".E5.B4.AD.E6.96.B0.E5.8D.95.E5.93.81_All-new_Item\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"崭新单品_All-new_Item\">崭新单品<small style=\"color: grey\"> <span style=\"display:inline-block\">All-new Item</span></small></span></h2><div class=\"char-item-box0 tabber\"><div class=\"char-item-box1 tabber-item\" data-skinid=\"314003\"><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-314004.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/7/7b/Belonging-314004.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\">外显的智慧<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">Wisdom Made Manifest</div></div></div><div><img alt=\"雨滴\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bb/Value-1.png/27px-Value-1.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"雨滴\" width=\"27\" height=\"18\" style=\"vertical-align: text-bottom\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/b/bb/Value-1.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"36\" data-file-height=\"24\" />1.7<hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>柔滑的、晃动的……布制大脑。经笔者验证，这只精巧礼帽中并无任何活性成分。<br />每位疯狂科学家都应以自己的头脑为豪，那是他们一切功业的基石，是发表怪杰宣言时的优越感来源。正因如此，受访者在十月来临之际，为自己定制了这样一顶礼帽。</div></div></div><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-314005.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/4/47/Belonging-314005.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\">特供搏动<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">Pulse Visualized</div></div></div><div><img alt=\"利齿子儿\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/62/Value-2.png/27px-Value-2.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"利齿子儿\" width=\"27\" height=\"18\" style=\"vertical-align: text-bottom\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/6/62/Value-2.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"36\" data-file-height=\"24\" />58<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"float: right;\">信任达到60%解锁</div><hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>殷红色丝带胸花，造型来自受访者的笔记本涂鸦。<br />赋无生命之物以生命、感情和跳动的心——一项标准疯狂科学家事业，正适合为此花上整个十月。仅在本月，她的工作室会变成一间幽暗工坊，专供苏醒的冰冷巨石栖居。<br />以上均为受访者身着节日特别服装作出的介绍。她欢迎读者前来一探究竟。</div></div></div><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-314006.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/4/4b/Belonging-314006.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\">“下一步”<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">\"The Next Step\"</div></div></div><div><img alt=\"雨滴\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bb/Value-1.png/27px-Value-1.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"雨滴\" width=\"27\" height=\"18\" style=\"vertical-align: text-bottom\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/b/bb/Value-1.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"36\" data-file-height=\"24\" />3<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"float: right;\">信任达到100%解锁</div><hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>优雅、趁手、必要的沉重，具备好手杖的一切品质。它能为石材们指挥方向，也能在黑夜中招引雷电。更重要的是，它或许能令同甲方的交涉更顺利。<br />“为什么疯狂科学家有甲方？”<br />“不要在意细节。说真的，你在工作时间，不会偶尔想拥有这样一根手杖吗？”受访者如是回答。</div></div></div></div></div><div id=\"全新语音\"></div><h2><span id=\".E5.85.A8.E6.96.B0.E8.AF.AD.E9.9F.B3_New_Voice\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"全新语音_New_Voice\">全新语音<small style=\"color: grey\"> <span style=\"display:inline-block\">New Voice</span></small></span></h2><div><table class=\"wikitable responsive voice-table zh-only\" style=\"margin:0; --size: 23px; width:100%\"><tbody><tr class=\"hide-m\" style=\"vertical-align:middle\"><td style=\"text-align:center\"><img alt=\"Tupo xindiantu.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistat